  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNODC Accelerating UNCAC implementation globally</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UNODC United Nations Office on Drugs and Crime, is provided for the acceleration of the implementation of  UN Convention against corruption (UNCAC) globally.  There are three objectives
1) Technical assistance in support of accelrated UNCAC implementation 
2) Facilitating an integrated response to address technical assistance needs for effective and timely asset recovery 
3) Developing adequate responses to corruption involving vast quantities of assets</narrative>
  </description>
